5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to make sure we all pay the same! I'll check all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Sakura. I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and valley inn rates versus urban beds.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand our group dynamic better. I'll check time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
