25,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"All-in rates mean everyone pays the same regardless of appetite, and renting a whole building is much fairer than separate rooms!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Offshore houses are quite cheap per head, but the valley inns are more expensive since they include breakfast and dinner.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year we barely saw each other, but in a shared house, there was absolutely no place to go for a moment of peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry takes up two whole days of our trip. The train to the spa valley is much faster, only ninety minutes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn has great bath hours, but everyone sleeps in one room on futons and meals are on a strict schedule.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if the offshore houses are cheap and the bill is one total, that sounds perfect for us.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is, but we have to consider the total cost. City beds are very expensive and meals are extra.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if we go to a city, would that give us the balance of being together but having our own space?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Probably, and the transport is effortless. The spa valley bus is limited and stops early in the evening.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about the island. One bathroom for everyone and cold water sounds like a nightmare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, but wouldn't a city be too expensive if we book separately?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. The price gap for separate rooms last time was huge. A single bill is much safer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we stay at an inn, we are forced to be together, but Daisuke mentioned the room arrangements are tight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The island trip wastes too much time on the ferry. I can't spend two days just moving.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, I really don't like the idea of a strict timetable for meals and sleeping in one big room.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
