50,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I love the idea of the Island Trip because the cost is shared evenly and it's cheap!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The Island Trip is the most budget-predictable, but the City Break is too risky financially.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Midori,,I think the Hot Spring Town is a good middle ground for spending time together without being trapped.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town. The travel time is minimal and the transport is simple.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I can't do the island bathrooms or the inn's shared room. I vote for the City Break.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, but you'll have your own room in the city! That's better for your sleep, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the inn is more expensive, but at least it's a fixed rate for the meals.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, if you hate the inn's schedule, the city is definitely your best bet.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The city is too loose. We'll end up not seeing each other at all, like last year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'd rather be alone than stressed by a shared bathroom and a 6 AM wake-up call.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm torn, but I'll stick with the Island Trip for the fairness of the bill.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll vote for the Island Trip. It's the only way to ensure the cost is exactly what we expect.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll vote for the Hot Spring Town to ensure we actually bond this year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Hot Spring Town is the most efficient use of our time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,City Break. I need my own space and a door I can close.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
